    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="controller_8hpp_1af928d8b9ced02f7387b9b56ed3877b11" kindref="member">Client</ref> entity for the providers table with a get-services query. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends <ref refid="controller_8hpp_1af928d8b9ced02f7387b9b56ed3877b11" kindref="member">Client</ref> with a query that returns every service (clinic, pharmacy, radiology centre or laboratory) where the provider is an owner, admin or listed in the JSON staff array. The provider id is bound twice because it is used both as a numeric key and as a JSON text value. <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classapi_1_1v2_1_1Client_1a787dc26f0c3eda19fab0dd719f0e35c4" kindref="member">Client</ref>, Types::Data_t </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
